        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>regulation of growth by exogenous signal</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>regulation of growth by exogenous stimuli</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>regulation of growth by exogenous stimulus</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>regulation of growth by external signal</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>regulation of growth by external stimuli</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>regulation of growth by external stimulus</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
