        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>dsRNA biosynthesis</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>dsRNA biosynthetic process</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
