        <obo:IAO_0000115>The orderly movement of a neuroblast from one site to another, often during the development of a multicellular organism or multicellular structure. A neuroblast is any cell that will divide and give rise to a neuron.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>pr</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2012-10-29T08:24:37Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
