        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001296"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A luminous flux quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s emitting longer wavelength light following the absorption of shorter wavelength radiation; fluorescence is common with aromatic compounds with several rings joined together.</obo:IAO_0000115>
