        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000965"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A symmetry quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s being symmetric about a plane running from its frontal end to its caudal end (head to tail), and has nearly identical right and left halves.</obo:IAO_0000115>
