        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A symmetry quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s being symmetric about a plane running from its frontal end to its caudal end (head to tail), and has nearly identical right and left halves.</owl:annotatedTarget>
