        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001884"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s lacking affinity for water; tending to repel and not absorb water; tending not to dissolve in or mix with or be wetted by water.</obo:IAO_0000115>
