        <obo:IAO_0000115>A color for which RHS Colour Chart chip 158A or 158B in the fifth edition (2007) is the closest visual match when the specimen is compared against a white background under artificial daylight conforming to CIE D6500; those chips serve as physical prototypes for cream in a botanical description.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8149-5890"/>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2026-07-11T18:39:19Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
