        <rdfs:comment>Requested for FLOPO; corresponding temporary class: FLOPO_0980200. UPOV treats hispid and setose as narrower botanical indumentum terms, but PATO:0002289 setose remains directly under hairy because its cross-taxon use includes insect setae, which are not all bristles.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>bristly</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
